cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Helix Core in your research, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "Helix Core: an open-source desktop platform for computational drug discovery"
abstract: >-
  Helix Core is a desktop application that integrates structure preparation,
  molecular docking (AutoDock Vina), post-docking analysis, descriptor-based
  compound triage, molecular design, and results management into a single
  graphical interface built on RDKit, Open Babel, and Meeko.
type: software
authors:
